{
  "about": "Scrolling from the keyboard (sample/ScrollProbe.tsx; docs/react-native-android-adaptation.mdx, Scrolling), as a Mac's scroll view takes the keys its first responder leaves and Android's ScrollView.executeKeyEvent takes them for React: Page Down and Page Up, Space and Shift+Space a page (Safari's: the view's height less 40, at least seven eighths of it), the arrows a line (40), Home and End (and Ctrl+↑ and Ctrl+↓, a Mac's ⌘↑ and ⌘↓) to the ends, each animated as Android's ScrollView.smoothScrollBy animates it, React hearing only its scrolls. With nothing focused the window's main scroll view (the largest) takes them, across for ← and → (the strip); with a control focused, the scroll view it is in, the focus kept; a focused field keeps its keys, the stepper its arrows and a row its Space; a scroll view at its end still takes the key, and nothing moves or hears it. Every step checks exactly what React received, the offsets, the keyboard's focus, what the host took and the scrollbar shown and faded. at 1.25 (a 1600x1000 output), each offset on the display's pixels.",
  "module": "ScrollProbe",
  "window": [
    640,
    400
  ],
  "outputs": "1600x1000@1.25",
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "Page Down with nothing focused: the window's main scroll view (the largest) a page down, Safari's page (its height less 40, at least seven eighths), animated: its scrolls alone, its scrollbar shown and faded out",
      "do": [
        "key",
        109
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {
          "scroll@main": [
            6,
            17
          ]
        },
        "scroll_offset": {
          "main": [
            0,
            244.8
          ]
        },
        "host_input": {
          "keyboard.scroll": 1
        },
        "scrollbars": {
          "shown@main": 1,
          "hidden@main": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Space: a page more",
      "do": [
        "key",
        57
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {
          "scroll@main": [
            6,
            17
          ]
        },
        "scroll_offset": {
          "main": [
            0,
            489.6
          ]
        },
        "host_input": {
          "keyboard.scroll": 1
        },
        "scrollbars": {
          "shown@main": 1,
          "hidden@main": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Shift+Space: a page back",
      "do": [
        "key",
